# Scene2-3-5

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐3‐5
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:28_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『中庭』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_28_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:走进中庭的时候，<br>我看到亚里沙正躺在吊床上歇息。|#0203Adv05_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:你不打算参加舞台剧制作吗？|#0203Adv05_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我走到亚里沙身边对她说道。<br>亚里沙嫌弃地坐起身来。|#0203Adv05_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off
@Wait WaitMode:0.6

[PrintTextModified Text:谁要干那种事。|#0203Adv05_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么？你应该多提升自己和他人的协作能力。|#0203Adv05_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙厌烦地瞪了瞪我。|#0203Adv05_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:啧……烦不烦啊。<br>而且说回来，你一开始不是也反对吗。|#0203Adv05_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。<br>但是，我现在认为这是有必要的。|#0203Adv05_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:加深大家的感情，有助于抑制凶杀案发生。<br>我不希望再有人牺牲了。|#0203Adv05_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……你这些话都是真心的？<br>依我看，<br>你是最有可能动手杀人的那个就是了。|#0203Adv05_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:仿佛在揣摩我的真实想法一般，<br>亚里沙直勾勾地盯着我看。|#0203Adv05_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你这家伙的话果然信不过。<br>怎么可能跟你这种人好好相处。|#0203Adv05_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这点我深有同感。<br>我也不觉得能跟你好好相处。|#0203Adv05_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:可是基本的协作能力还是要有的吧？|#0203Adv05_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我向亚里沙露出一个微笑。<br>但她却恶狠狠地瞪了瞪我，那双眼睛仿佛要喷出熊熊大火似的。|#0203Adv05_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:周围的空气一下子剑拔弩张起来。|#0203Adv05_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@HidePrinter

; 野外で近づいてくる足音・1人
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_73 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，还有亚里沙，<br>你们在聊什么呀？|#0203Adv05_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:又来了一个烦人的家伙……|#0203Adv05_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅出现后，亚里沙紧绷的弦突然放松，<br>声音中有些逃避的意思。|#0203Adv05_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:我是不是打扰你们聊天了？|#0203Adv05_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没有，我们就只是闲聊。|#0203Adv05_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:那就好。话说回来……<br>希罗，你决定好要干什么没有？|#0203Adv05_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro

[PrintTextModified Text:还没有。我还正在看呢。|#0203Adv05_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia

[PrintTextModified Text:是吗。不用焦急，仔细想好再决定就行。|#0203Adv05_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro

[PrintTextModified Text:你到这里来是要干什么？|#0203Adv05_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想一边研读剧本，<br>一边简单练习一下台词。|#0203Adv05_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:给我到其他地方练习去啊……|#0203Adv05_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:不好意思，那可能有点难。<br>因为正式表演我也打算在这里办。|#0203Adv05_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:只是练习而已，你到其他地方不也照样能练。|#0203Adv05_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:我想尽量在一个跟表演场地相近的环境下排练嘛。|#0203Adv05_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一提到舞台剧，蕾雅会变得很严肃，<br>同时也让人感觉乐在其中。|#0203Adv05_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来，她身上散发出来的光芒，以及积极向上的态度，<br>正是一种能牵引其他人一同前进的力量。|#0203Adv05_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:啊对了，正好你在这里。<br>其实我有事想拜托亚里沙帮忙。|#0203Adv05_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊？突然说的什么啊。|#0203Adv05_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想在剧中增加角色。<br>希望亚里沙也能……|#0203Adv05_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa

[PrintTextModified Text:我绝对不会答应。|#0203Adv05_Alisa009| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不等蕾雅说完，亚里沙就打断她的话，表现出拒绝的态度。|#0203Adv05_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Cry1,ArmR8,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:别这么说嘛！这个角色只能交给你来演！<br>是司掌火焰的小仙子……！|#0203Adv05_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……为什么是我来演小仙子啊！<br>应该还有其他角色吧！？<br>不对，我根本不打算演什么舞台剧！|#0203Adv05_Alisa010| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Cry1,ArmR1,ArmL4
@HideActors ActorIds:Alisa Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:等等，亚里沙！|#0203Adv05_Leia011| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 野外を走る音・1人
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_173 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR8,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:走掉了……|#0203Adv05_Leia012| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着亚里沙飞奔而去的背影，<br>蕾雅沮丧地小声说道。|#0203Adv05_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:对了，希罗。|#0203Adv05_Leia013| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅转头看向我，<br>这时她已经换上了一副和善的笑容。|#0203Adv05_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:变脸变得真快啊。<br>怎么有一种不祥的预感……|#0203Adv05_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我啊，还是想让你也来演小仙子。|#0203Adv05_Leia014| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么又是小仙子。|#0203Adv05_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR5,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:可是你想想，小仙子们围绕着我这个主演，是给周围增色的角色！<br>我认为这是舞台剧中非常重要的一点！|#0203Adv05_Leia015| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:请容我拒绝。<br>我再找找看有什么能帮忙的。|#0203Adv05_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; 野外で立ち去る足音・1人
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_72 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:不管是亚里沙还是希罗都不好摆平呢。<br>但我是不会放弃的……呵呵呵。|#0203Adv05_Leia016| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:背后传来蕾雅无所畏忌的笑声。|#0203Adv05_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

